        "TileImage": "$($repository d488c3a9-1e74-4704-a852-207b9b881e0e).Image",
        "Description": "We studied the artifact you found in the helicopter 47. It seems that it is some sort of tool that can be used help open the &quot;Lost Ark&quot;. In one of the documents we also found evidence that Russia is after the ark. It appears some of the scriptures on the ritual on how to open it was sent for translation to Morocco. Your target is the linguist Shanin Abdul working for the Russians, and their operatives. It seems the Russians believe they can get godly powers from the ark. Be careful 47.",
